<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Patrick Tenney raised his recommendation on Read-Rite Corp to long-term attractive from market performer.</p>
<p>-- raised his 1997 earnings estimate to $1.89 from $1.20 based on stronger than expected first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- Read-Rite stock rose 2-1/2 to 32-1/8 in afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
